<!-- Absorbed verbatim from joe.cephaloids ("Cephaloids", workshop 3753477123),
     source file Patches/Joes_Cephaloids_Patches.xml. STAT_NORM_WAVE2_RETIRE_1.
     This is the donor's ENTIRE patch surface (17 ops, 1 file); own gates
     (MayRequire="Ludeon.Rimworld.Odyssey") unchanged. Of the 23 biomes this
     repo paints as Ash'karr, AridShrubland/Desert/ExtremeDesert/Scarlands/
     LavaField are the 5 that receive an addition here (JOE_Cephalope and/or
     JOE_Nautilant); the remaining operations target biomes not painted on
     the frozen Ash'karr world and are inert there, same as upstream. -->
